# ============================================================================
# Clever Clogs: where you left your things, and how long you spent with them.
#
#   Anything Bluetooth is a thing: the car, headphones, a key tag, the bike,
#   the keyboard on your desk. Choose them once. From then on the phone notes
#   where it was each time one goes out of range, even with this app shut, and
#   when it comes back. So it can say where you left the car, and how long you
#   sat at your desk today.
#
#   Where   where the chosen thing is (or where you saved a place by hand),
#           how long ago, how many floors up or down, and the way back.
#   Things  what the phone watches for, what kind each is, adding and removing.
#   Time    a day's timeline with each thing, the day's and the week's totals,
#           and the lot as a CSV file for a timesheet.
#
#   What it uses, all through Vml(...):
#     GetLocation, TakePhoto, Share, OpenUrl, SaveFile   any phone, and most browsers
#     BluetoothDevices, WatchBluetooth,
#     BluetoothLog, Pressure                             the Visualised app on Android
#   On a computer it opens and explains itself, but has nothing to find.
#
#   Made with Visualised. The scripts are at the bottom; "Start" runs first.
# ============================================================================

@Window CleverClogs
Title=Clever Clogs
Version=2.1
Icon=CleverClogs.png
Width=360
Height=640
OnOpened=Start
AndroidPackage=io.visualised.made.cleverclogs.k7b1ce6cd
AndroidKey=7b1ce6cd

